[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0360","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0360.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0351","title":"SCO UnixWare 软件包管理命令权限提升漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 7.1.0 系统中的软件包管理命令存在不安全的权限配置漏洞，本地攻击者利用该漏洞可绕过权限限制添加或删除系统软件包，影响系统的完整性和可用性。攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，无需特殊条件即可利用，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0351"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:32.180","remediation":"立即应用 SCO 官方安全公告 SB-99.09b 中提供的补丁，升级受影响软件包至修复版本。如无法立即打补丁，可移除受影响打包命令（如 pkgadd、pkgrm 等）的 setuid/setgid 权限位，并严格限制本地用户仅授权可信管理员登录系统，以降低本地提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0351.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0351","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0351.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0351.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-86q7-rq88-2w73/GHSA-86q7-rq88-2w73.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0351.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88305/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/48d9bee10ba6f9c95b14d9de429f21fee40e28eb/2000.tsv","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/ad32beb8a6ecc99ff5b9401392fe4eb738c13e96/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-03xx/CVE-2000-0351.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0360.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0357","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0357.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0349","title":"SCO UnixWare 7.1.0 Passthru Driver 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 7.1.0 操作系统的 Passthru 驱动程序中存在安全漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络访问向目标系统发送特制请求，触发驱动程序处理异常导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 SCO UnixWare 7.1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。由于该漏洞年代久远且厂商已停止支持，建议用户迁移至受支持的操作系统版本以避免风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0349"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:31.923","remediation":"立即应用 SCO 安全公告 SB-99.13a 中提供的 passthru 驱动补丁，升级到修复后的 UnixWare 7.1.0 版本。由于 SCO UnixWare 已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的 Unix/Linux 系统；若无法迁移，可在网络边界防火墙阻断对 passthru 驱动相关端口的非授权访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0349.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0349","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0349.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0349.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-9x84-pg52-6jhq/GHSA-9x84-pg52-6jhq.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0349.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88303/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/48d9bee10ba6f9c95b14d9de429f21fee40e28eb/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--fd5163ad-209e-42a8-a9f3-22d9a212ed74.owl","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0357.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0314","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0314.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0315","title":"NetBSD traceroute 本地源地址伪造漏洞","description":"NetBSD 1.3.3 及部分 Linux 系统中的 traceroute 工具存在源地址伪造漏洞。本地低权限用户可修改 traceroute 所发送数据包的源 IP 地址，从而发起 IP 欺骗攻击。攻击者利用此漏洞可伪造数据包来源，绕过基于 IP 的访问控制或隐藏攻击来源。该漏洞需要本地系统访问权限，攻击条件受限，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0315"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:27.607","remediation":"升级 NetBSD 至 1.4 及以上版本，或应用 NetBSD-SA1999-004 提供的 traceroute 补丁修复 waittime 参数未作边界检查导致 select(2) 立即返回的缺陷。临时缓解措施可执行 `chmod u-s /usr/sbin/traceroute` 移除 suid 位，仅允许 root 用户运行 traceroute。Linux 系统应更新 traceroute 至支持源地址合法性校验的版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91893782027835&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/7575","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0315.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0315","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0315.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0315.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-jf7m-pxqr-jvc5/GHSA-jf7m-pxqr-jvc5.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_400_500.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88342/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0315.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-269.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0314.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0314.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0313","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0313.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0314","title":"NetBSD 和 Linux traceroute 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetBSD 1.3.3 及部分 Linux 系统中 traceroute 工具存在参数解析缺陷，本地用户可通过向 -w（waittime）选项传入超长数值，导致程序内部解析异常并将数据包发送延迟置为零。攻击者可利用该漏洞以极快速度向目标系统发送大量数据包，造成网络拥塞或拒绝服务。该漏洞需要本地用户权限才能触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0314"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:27.480","remediation":"NetBSD 用户应立即应用 19990217-traceroute 补丁（可从 ftp.NetBSD.ORG 获取），或升级至 NetBSD 1.3.3 以上版本。临时缓解措施：执行 `chmod u-s /usr/sbin/traceroute` 移除 traceroute 的 setuid 位，限制仅 root 用户可运行。Linux 用户应升级 traceroute 至 1.4a7 以上版本，或通过包管理器安装更新（如 `apt-get update && apt-get upgrade traceroute`）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91893782027835&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/7574","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0314.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0314","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0314.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0314.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-c4h3-4hjj-m5cr/GHSA-c4h3-4hjj-m5cr.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88343/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0314.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ae4bac31-af94-4f46-9c2a-778b17bc2995.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--ae4bac31-af94-4f46-9c2a-778b17bc2995.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0313.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0307","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0307.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0313","title":"OpenBSD 网络接口媒体配置本地提权漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 2.6 系统中存在本地权限配置漏洞，具有系统访问权限的本地用户可通过修改网络接口媒体配置参数，导致系统网络功能异常或降级。该漏洞源于系统对接口配置操作缺少充分的权限校验，攻击者需拥有本地 shell 访问权限才能利用。受影响版本为 OpenBSD 2.6，危害等级中危，建议升级至高版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0313"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:27.350","remediation":"该漏洞存在于 OpenBSD 2.6，任何本地用户均可通过 ifmedia ioctl 修改网络接口介质配置。建议立即从 OpenBSD 官方 errata 页面下载并应用编号 002 的源码补丁，或升级至 OpenBSD 2.7 及以上版本。若无法升级，可限制本地用户登录或禁用受影响接口的 ifmedia 功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openbsd.org/errata.html#ifmedia","http://www.osvdb.org/7540","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0313.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0313","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0313.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0313.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-84m3-hwqx-qqwm/GHSA-84m3-hwqx-qqwm.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0313.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--23b012c2-b67b-4bcc-9726-63a0784bfb73.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f3526cd689b486e2ddce9b934197355bd7bbd3ae/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--23b012c2-b67b-4bcc-9726-63a0784bfb73.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0307.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0303","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0303.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0312","title":"OpenBSD cron 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 2.5 系统的 cron（时钟守护进程）在处理 argv[] 参数时存在空终止符缺失漏洞，导致函数指针数组未被正确终止，传递给 cron 的伪 popen 函数后可被利用。本地攻击者可通过构造特制的命令行参数触发此内存处理缺陷，成功利用可实现权限提升，获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 2.5 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议升级至不受影响的版本或应用补丁修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0312"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:27.240","remediation":"升级 OpenBSD 至 2.6 及以上版本，其中已修复 cron 进程的 argv 空终止检查。若无法升级，可限制本地用户对 cron 作业的写入权限，并移除 crontab 的 setuid 位作为临时缓解措施。编译时启用栈保护选项也可增加利用难度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openbsd.org/errata25.html#cron","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0312.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0312","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0312.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0312.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-835h-phw4-qgfr/GHSA-835h-phw4-qgfr.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_0_100.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88301/info.html","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-170.txt","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d9e690522c86144671671f4250daa9ba0347e09/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-03xx/CVE-2000-0312.json","https://github.com/ragiko/ntcir11/blob/e5b134c4e6784918dbfdc8a01d2c276d1847b032/workspace/gensim_sentence2vec/extract/36646.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0303.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0303.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0301","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0301.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0310","title":"OpenBSD 2.4 IP分片重组拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 2.4 内核 IP 分片重组模块存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送大量精心构造的 IP 分片数据包，触发分片重组缓冲区过度消耗，导致系统资源枯竭并引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 2.4 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0310"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:26.990","remediation":"立即升级至 OpenBSD 2.5 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本修复。如无法升级，请依次应用 OpenBSD 2.4 errata 补丁：先安装 #006（ipq 竞态条件修复）和 #010（TCP 解码修复），再安装 #008（IP 分片重组修复），补丁可从 openbsd.org/errata24.html 获取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openbsd.org/errata24.html#maxqueue","http://www.osvdb.org/7539","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0310.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0310","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0310.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0310.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mx9m-hpp3-577c/GHSA-mx9m-hpp3-577c.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88302/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0310.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--658a1d9e-1953-4321-84a4-211412643893.owl","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0301.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0298","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0298.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0309","title":"OpenBSD 2.4 DDB 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 2.4 系统在启用 DDB（内核调试器）的情况下，其 i386 架构的 trace-trap 处理机制存在安全缺陷。本地攻击者可通过触发特定的追踪陷阱（trace-trap）导致系统内核崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 2.4 版本，需要攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，无法远程利用，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0309"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:26.870","remediation":"升级至 OpenBSD 2.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 i386 跟踪陷阱处理中的拒绝服务漏洞。如无法升级，在编译内核时移除 DDB 选项（`option DDB`），禁用内核调试器以消除攻击面。限制本地用户对系统的交互式访问权限亦可作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openbsd.org/errata24.html#trctrap","http://www.osvdb.org/6126","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0309.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0309","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0309.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0309.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cmfj-xq93-7whq/GHSA-cmfj-xq93-7whq.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0309.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88324/info.html","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--b6f440bf-14a3-4986-a606-f51b5f75ec48.owl","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0298.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0297","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0297.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0307","title":"SCO OpenServer xserver 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 2.1.x 及 OpenServer 5.05 及更早版本中的 xserver 组件存在安全漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 xserver 发送特制请求导致系统拒绝服务，使得系统无法正常分配 1024 以下的保留端口号，影响关键网络服务的正常运行。该漏洞利用条件简单，攻击者需具有本地访问权限即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0307"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:26.633","remediation":"升级至 SCO OpenServer 5.0.6 或更高版本，该版本已修复 xserver 对保留端口（1024 以下）的访问控制缺陷。无法升级时，可通过限制本地用户对 X 服务器的访问权限或禁用 xserver 的 setuid 位作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0307.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0307","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0307.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0307.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-ffrr-675f-6pxv/GHSA-ffrr-675f-6pxv.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88291/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0307.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--53416e9c-1682-4fa9-b69f-2cb50fd99cfe.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/a3d797a054f33a26fc99648a4e1cc47b2bce8d08/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0297.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0264","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0264.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0306","title":"SCO OpenServer calserver 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SCO OpenServer 系统中的 calserver 组件存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的超长消息，触发 calserver 中的缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者能够以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 SCO OpenServer 及 SCO UNIX 5 系列版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前厂商已发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0306"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:26.513","remediation":"立即从 ftp://ftp.sco.com/SSE/security_bulletins/SB-99.02a 获取并安装 SCO OpenServer 安全补丁 SB-99.02a。如无法安装补丁，可在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释掉 calserver 服务行并重启 inetd 以禁用该服务，同时在防火墙层面限制对 457/TCP 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=1998-12-29&msg=AAh6GYsGU1%40leshka.chuvashia.su","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20620","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0306.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0306","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0306.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0306.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/309.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-rx9m-8fvp-xhpf/GHSA-rx9m-8fvp-xhpf.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/exploit.rules","https://github.com/bailehang/snort_2.2.0/blob/34f8a3a85f15645aea53d6e0d46863c7c57e43ef/doc/signatures/304.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0306.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0264.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0997","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0997.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0893","title":"SGI IRIX dgld服务远程信息泄露漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX系统的分布式GL守护进程（dgld）运行在5232端口，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标主机发送探测数据包识别出该系统为SGI IRIX主机，从而获取系统指纹信息。该漏洞影响运行dgld服务的SGI IRIX系统，攻击条件仅为网络可达，目标主机暴露了5232端口。攻击者可利用此信息进一步探测内网SGI系统并制定后续攻击策略。Microsoft虽未直接修复此漏洞，但SGI官方已在后续版本中移除或禁用dgld服务以消除信息泄露风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0893"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:41.487","remediation":"在SGI IRIX系统上禁用Distributed GL Daemon（dgld）服务：执行`/etc/init.d/dgld stop`或通过系统管理工具关闭dgld进程。若系统依赖dgld功能，可在防火墙层面阻止外部对5232端口的访问（如使用`ipfilter`规则拒绝入站TCP 5232流量），以防止攻击者通过扫描该端口识别IRIX系统并发起后续攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/28027","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7bafe961419ed00378435555d77a3a118a4791ff/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0893.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0893","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/b8f59055aaa174ba5d49c72e4d9d07129f46db91/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0893.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8109cc9beabe213e111588d9156148e0cfb893b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0893.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/812e13284092701ac2e48a9865618a02a3b2d95e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wgrm-7mq3-m654/GHSA-wgrm-7mq3-m654.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0893.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88587/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3a51f09f98be08b3936fd71fa5fc92e8fcb2a789/2000.tsv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0893.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0893.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0997.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0994","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0994.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0890","title":"FreeBSD periodic 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 系统中的 periodic 命令在 4.1.1 及更早版本存在符号链接竞争条件漏洞。该命令以 root 权限执行系统定期维护任务时，会在临时目录创建日志文件，但由于未对文件创建过程进行安全校验，具有本地访问权限的低权限攻击者可预先在目标路径放置指向系统关键文件的符号链接。当 periodic 进程打开并写入该文件时，实际会以 root 权限覆写符号链接所指向的任意文件内容，例如 /etc/passwd、/etc/crontab 或 /etc/rc.conf 等核心配置文件。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 4.1.1 及更早版本系统，要求攻击者拥有本地用户账户或 shell 访问权限即可发起利用。成功利用后攻击者可篡改系统配置文件、植入持久化后门或提升至 root 权限，严重威胁系统完整性与可用性。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0890"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:41.107","remediation":"立即运行 sysinstall 或 freebsd-update 升级 FreeBSD 到修复版本（4.1.1-RELEASE 或更高版本）；或手动修改 /etc/periodic.conf 将临时目录从 /tmp 改为 /var/tmp，并确保 periodic 脚本使用 mktemp 创建不可预测的临时文件名，避免使用 /tmp/periodic.$PID 形式。临时缓解措施：以 root 身份执行 rm /tmp/periodic.* 清除所有可疑符号链接文件，并定期检查 /tmp 目录下是否存在指向敏感文件的 symbolic link。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/626919","http://www.osvdb.org/1754","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2325","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6047","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2a32ec57edd83fdc49e3ed310ea4dfd02c6ae080/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0890.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0890","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/21f29c262df67f8fba785d468c4552b0e1fc4211/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0890.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7d8adad2ca0fd0f45e0565820d22b5b3d75da10a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0890.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/734adcc0a68fbe95325e836d2469be64740b89d7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4c95-3x3c-f7fm/GHSA-4c95-3x3c-f7fm.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0890.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--02649480-cef8-43db-8ee8-79c88113d85c.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0890.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0994.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1689","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1689.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0895","title":"WatchGuard SOHO Firewall 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务代码执行漏洞","description":"WatchGuard SOHO 防火墙的 HTTP 服务器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送超长的 HTTP GET 请求触发该漏洞，导致服务崩溃并可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 WatchGuard SOHO 系列防火墙设备，CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击条件宽松且利用门槛低。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0895"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:41.840","remediation":"WatchGuard 已于 2001 年初发布针对此漏洞的固件更新。建议立即将 SOHO 防火墙固件升级至 v2.2.1 或更高版本（通过 WatchGuard System Manager 进行固件刷写）。若不确定当前版本，可登录 Web 管理界面查看状态页。由于该产品已停产且不再获得安全更新，建议淘汰老旧 SOHO 设备，更换为受支持的 WatchGuard Firebox 系列硬件并升级至最新 Fireware OS，同时在网络边界配置访问控制列表（ACL）限制对管理端口的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/4403","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2114","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise70.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5218","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/12b3733bfd1230e92fdd480cbc71e829b404ab11/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0895.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0895","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/98c25b568de9f5663060bd4b7b00b621bdb6209c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0895.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9d2dce20ba2fe9e2d5a2e58ec9557e564875fd32/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0895.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/488b85f0d34fb24f766dfaf0172b8e396f289cb2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4xx6-xq76-3343/GHSA-4xx6-xq76-3343.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0895.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0895.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--90491071-a7df-41b3-9df8-d04d3fbb5b69.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1689.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1688","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1688.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0894","title":"WatchGuard SOHO 防火墙拒绝服务漏洞","description":"WatchGuard SOHO 防火墙内置 HTTP 服务器未对管理功能（如密码重置、设备重启）进行充分的访问控制与身份验证，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可直接通过 HTTP 请求调用这些管理接口，从而造成防火墙拒绝服务或执行未授权操作。该漏洞影响运行 SOHO 系列固件的 WatchGuard 防火墙设备，攻击者无需任何凭据即可利用，攻击条件简单，攻击向量为网络可达。由于该漏洞的 CVSS 评分为满分 10.0，属于最高严重等级，可被利用导致完全的系统可用性丧失与管理权限的非法获取，危害极大。WatchGuard 已发布固件更新以修复该漏洞，建议用户升级至安全版本并限制防火墙管理接口的网络访问范围。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0894"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:41.627","remediation":"升级到 WatchGuard SOHO 防火墙最新固件版本，启用管理员访问控制限制远程管理端口，仅允许受信任 IP 地址访问管理界面，并关闭不必要的 HTTP 管理服务以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/4404","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2119","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise70.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5554","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/359275c189930ab08ca487bc0726b002a25eef84/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0894.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0894","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/b3f812bd4b5f3ade59f8b9defed21f6c3f9dab55/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0894.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/58ee4ff7906d19f4609c9ca9aa75dfba481e1462/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0894.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/910571d59d22fbdbea839cde6c4e84df23ffdc82/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6wg3-727j-rhxv/GHSA-6wg3-727j-rhxv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0894.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0894.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c0c60f33-bf5a-4b89-965b-8d318f98c0af.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1688.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0998","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0998.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0896","title":"WatchGuard SOHO Firewall IP Fragmentation 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"WatchGuard SOHO Firewall 1.6 及 2.1.3 版本在处理 IP 分片数据包时存在安全缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标设备发送大量特制的 IP 分片数据包，导致防火墙连接中断并停止转发数据包，最终引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 WatchGuard SOHO Firewall 系列产品，攻击者只需具备网络访问能力即可发起攻击，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0896"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:42.733","remediation":"建议立即升级至 WatchGuard Firebox 系列最新固件版本（如 FireOS 12.10 或更高版本），并禁用防火墙的 IP 分片重组功能。若设备已停止维护无法升级，请在网络边界部署入侵防御系统（IPS）拦截异常分片流量，并将旧设备隔离至受管网段，限制其对外暴露面。建议联系 WatchGuard 官方技术支持确认最新固件版本及升级路径，完成设备替代或固件升级后验证分片攻击是否仍可复现。如暂无法替代设备，可在上游路由器配置 ACL 限制异常分片包转发，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1690","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2113","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise70.php","https://exchange.x